OL,3,GNEWSA'Magical day' as bikini song used
OL,4,Ain health demo
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaigner has described performing a
OL,7,F1960s pop hit outside Downing Street,
OL,8,Fas part of efforts to get more
OL,9,Fattention on her issue, as "magical".
OL,11,FAshleigh Harley, 27, was joined by
OL,12,Fsinger Brian Hyland, who recorded Itsy
OL,13,FBitsy Teenie Weenie Yellow Polkadot
OL,14,FBikini in 1960, for the performance on
OL,15,FSaturday, which she claimed attracted a
OL,16,Fcrowd of hundreds.
OL,18,FThe event was part of a campaign by
OL,19,FHarley calling for better diagnosis and
OL,20,Ftreatment for people with health
OL,21,Fconditions.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
